---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
import { getPhotoCredits, siteLastChecked } from '../lib/content';

const credits = await getPhotoCredits();
---

<Base title="About" lastChecked={await siteLastChecked()}>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About Scrutable</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-prose space-y-4">
    <p>Scrutable is a free site for people who will vote but have not followed a country's politics. It explains how the election works, who is running, what they stand for and what happened in the last five elections.</p>
    <p>It does not tell you who to vote for. There is no quiz, no ranking and no poll.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">What is on the site today</h2>
    <p>This is an early build with sample data only. Every person, result and source you see is a fictional placeholder, and the site says so on every page.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Who runs it and how it is funded</h2>
    <p>This section will be completed before public launch.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Photo credits</h2>
    <p>Portraits are stored on this site, not loaded from other sites. Each one is used under its licence, with credit.</p>
    {credits.length === 0 ? <p class="text-muted">No photos yet.</p> : (
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        {credits.map((c) => <li><span class="font-medium">{c.name}</span><PhotoCredit photo={c.photo} /></li>)}
      </ul>
    )}
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Your privacy</h2>
    <p>No cookies, no trackers, no accounts. We store nothing about you.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
